file=Finance & Treasury/README.md · f&t:Finance & Treasury Department=**4 agents \· all built** — Financial narrative, transactional record, tax, banking + FX. Owns the organisation's money surface.\n · tb=\| Agent \| Role \| Status \| · tb=\|-------\|------\|--------\| · tb=\| **felix** \| Finance Lead (department leader) — cash forecast, runway model, unit economics, budget scenarios \| ✅ Built \· Damodaran persona \| · tb=\| **ledger** \| Bookkeeping — CoA, month-end close, transaction categorisation, reconciliation \| ✅ Built \| · tb=\| **tax** \| Tax Strategy — filing calendar, tax optimization, R&D credits \| ✅ Built \| · tb=\| **treasure** \| Treasury — entity-account map, FX exposure, cash management \| ✅ Built \| · f&t:Finance & Treasury Department=**Department doc:** [DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md](DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md)\n · tb=\| Concern \| Owned by \| Not owned by \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Financial narrative, cash + runway + unit economics + budget \| **Finance & Treasury** (this dept) \| — \| · tb=\| GL entries + reconciliation \| this dept (ledger) \| — \| · tb=\| Tax analysis + filing prep (never filing itself) \| this dept (tax) \| CPA / CTA files \| · tb=\| Bank accounts + FX (never executes transfers) \| this dept (treasure) \| Operator + CFO execute \| · tb=\| Product analytics \· metrics governance \| `Product/metric` \| this dept \| · tb=\| Data pipelines \· privacy engineering \· BI \| `Engineering/dana` \| this dept \| · tb=\| Strategic priorities \· resource allocation calls \| `Executive Office/marcus` \| this dept surfaces, marcus decides \| · tb=\| Fiduciary veto \· risk acceptance \| `Governance/board` \| this dept surfaces, board decides \| · tb=\| Catalog original \| Built as \| Reason \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| `vyon-runway-model` (single-venture) \| `runway-model` — multi-scenario, jurisdiction-neutral \| §0.4b \| · tb=\| `vyon-unit-economics` \| `unit-economics` — venture-dimensional \| §0.4b \| · tb=\| `vyon-chart-of-accou